1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,890
(Sheldon:)Whether or not he was trying to kill me.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:05,269
(Sheldon:)For the record, I maintain he was.

3
00:00:07,314 --> 00:00:09,274
(Sheldon:)- Where are you going?
- I'm taking you home.

4
00:00:09,441 --> 00:00:11,571
(Sheldon:)But I'm not going home. It's Wednesday.

5
00:00:11,735 --> 00:00:15,575
(Sheldon:)Wednesday is New Comic Book Day.
We have to go to the comic-book store.

6
00:00:15,739 --> 00:00:19,579
And then we have to stop at Souplantation.
It's Creamy Tomato Soup Day.

7
00:00:19,743 --> 00:00:23,083
And RadioShack.
There's a sale on triple-A batteries.

8
00:00:23,246 --> 00:00:26,126
(Sheldon:)We have to go to Pottery Barn
and return my Star Wars sheets.

9
00:00:26,958 --> 00:00:28,248
(Raj:)I have a better idea.

10
00:00:29,336 --> 00:00:31,836
You wanna go to Pottery Barn first?

11
00:00:43,099 --> 00:00:45,599
(Sheldon:)Can you drive me to Pottery Barn?

12
00:00:51,358 --> 00:01:06,028
(Sheldon:)Maybe if I turn off the nightlight,
I can keep the sheets.

